  "unitComposition": "<ul><li>1 Aemelia Minervas model</li>\r<li>1 Ancient Gadriel model</li>\r<li>1 Dainal Kornelius model</li>\r<li>1 Gaius Silva model</li>\r<li>1 Lucia Vestha model</li>\r<li>1 Veteran Sergeant Metaurus model</li></ul>\rAemelia Minervas is equipped with: 1 Archeotech Laspistol; 1 Power Weapon.\rAncient Gadriel is equipped with: 1 Bolt Rifle; 1 Ceramite Fists.\rDainal Kornelius is equipped with: 1 Astropathic Blast; 1 Force Stave.\rGaius Silva is equipped with: 1 Archeotech Laspistol; 1 Power Weapon.\rLucia Vestha is equipped with: 1 Archeotech Laspistol; 1 Ultramarian Combat Weapons.\rVeteran Sergeant Metaurus is equipped with: 1 Heavy Bolt Pistol; 1 Master-crafted Power Weapon.",
