                  {
                    "id": 3437,
                    "name": "PSYCHIC",
                    "rules": "Each time an attack is made with a <b>[PSYCHIC]</b> weapon, you can ignore any or all modifiers to that attack’s <b>BS</b> or <b>WS</b> characteristic and any or all modifiers to the <b>hit roll</b>. Attacks made with <b>[PSYCHIC]</b> weapons are known as <b>psychic attacks</b> (this can be important for the triggering of other rules)."
